}

Policy requirements:

* reject unknown actions
* reject actions outside scope
* reject malformed recommendations
* reject low-confidence recommendations
* reject actions when authorization is missing
* default to dry-run
* record every decision
* fail closed when policy evaluation fails

Recommended commits:

