Follow this exact order:

1. Repository and CI
2. Documentation and threat model
3. Domain models
4. Event validation
5. Synthetic sensor
6. Detection rules
7. Threat scoring
8. Incident storage
9. Policy engine
10. Dry-run response
11. AI interface
12. AI output validation
13. Incident timeline
14. IOC extraction
15. Reporting
16. Deception simulation
17. Read-only operating-system sensor
18. Integration tests
19. Adversarial tests
20. Performance testing
21. Security review
